        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148627,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennen wir <code>health</code> und <code>score</code> in diesem Objekt?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Eigenschaften des Objekts</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Werte des Objekts</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Parameter des Objekts</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Eigenschaften des Objekts.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148628,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib dem <code>player</code>-Objekt die Eigenschaft <code>lives</code> mit dem Wert <code>3</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;lives&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lives\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>lives</code>, gefolgt von <code>:</code> und schließlich <code>3</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148629,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige die <code>health</code>-Eigenschaft des Objekts an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"69\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>player.health</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148630,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird <code>console.log(enemy.type);</code> anzeigen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.type = \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.type);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>goblin</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>slime</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"goblin\", \"slime\"]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>goblin slime</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>goblin</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148631,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was bewirkt in folgendem Code die Zeile <code>npc.state = \"alert\";</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" npc = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"state\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"npc.state = \" /><text value=\"&quot;alert&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ändert den Wert der <code>state</code>-Eigenschaft des Objekts von <code>\"idle\"</code> zu <code>\"alert\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nichts</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Erstellt eine <strong>neue</strong> Eigenschaft namens <code>state</code> mit dem Wert <code>\"alert\"</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Setzt die <code>state</code>-Eigenschaft des Objekts auf das Array <code>[\"idle\", \"alert\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ändert den Wert der <code>state</code>-Eigenschaft des Objekts von <code>\"idle\"</code> zu <code>\"alert\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148632,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setze den Code zusammen, um die Methode des Objekts zu erstellen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"method\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>attack</code>, gefolgt von <code>:</code> und schließlich <code>function</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>{}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148633,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Code wird ein <code>player</code>-Objekt anweisen, eine Methode namens <code>jump</code> auszuführen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>player.jump();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>player.jump;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>player:jump();</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>player.jump();</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148634,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge das fehlende Schlüsselwort hinzu, damit die Methode <code>isPaused</code> den Wert <code>true</code><code>return</code> wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dungeon Run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isPaused\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>return</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148635,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Schlüsselwort verwenden wir, um innerhalb einer Methode auf ein Objekt zu verweisen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>that</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">der Objektname</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148636,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fülle den Code aus, damit die Methode <code>isAlive</code> den Wert der Eigenschaft <code>alive</code><code>return</code> wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alive\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isAlive\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".alive;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>this</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>alive</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148637,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird die Konsole ausgeben?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Forest&quot;, &quot;enemyCount&quot;: 30, &quot;boss&quot;: &quot;Ent&quot;}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelData = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(level);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelData.name);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Forest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Error</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"name\": \"Forest\", \"enemyCount\": 30, \"boss\": \"Ent\"}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>Forest</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148638,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konvertiere das <code>items</code>-Array in einen JSON-String.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parse\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"148\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items = [{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rarity\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;common&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"heal\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elixir&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rarity\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;rare&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"heal\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(items));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>JSON</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>stringify</code>, <code>items</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148639,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird die Konsole ausgeben?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;weapon&quot;: &quot;sword&quot;, &quot;damage&quot;: 11, &quot;durability&quot;: 90}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" newObject = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(jsonString);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(newObject.damage);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>11</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"11\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>11</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148640,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Analysiere das folgende JSON-Objekt, um auf seine <code>weapon</code>-Eigenschaft zuzugreifen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;weapon&quot;: &quot;bow&quot;, &quot;damage&quot;: 5, &quot;durability&quot;: 48}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" obj = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(jsonString);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(obj.weapon);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>JSON.parse</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148641,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein JavaScript-Objekt und ein JSON-Objekt sind dieselben Datentypen.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Falsch. Sie sind unterschiedliche Datenstrukturen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Richtig. Sie sind gleich und wir können immer entweder verwenden</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Stimmt, aber JSON kann nur Booleans speichern</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Falsch. Sie sind unterschiedliche Datenstrukturen.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
